<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="dark">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Me - Climate Solutions</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

    <div class="container mx-auto">
        
        
        <div class="hero min-h-96 bg-base-200">
            <div class="hero-content text-center">
                <div class="max-w-md">
                    <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold">About Me</h1>
                    <p class="py-6">Learn more about my journey and interests</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 my-10">
            
            
            <div class="flex justify-center items-center">
                <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/400x500/4A90E2/FFFFFF?text=Your+Photo" 
                     alt="About Me" 
                     class="rounded-lg shadow-2xl max-w-full h-auto" />
            </div>

            
            <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Hello! I'm Dogukan</h2>
                <p class="mb-4">
                    I'm a Computer Programming student at Seneca College in Toronto, currently in my third semester. 
                    I have a background in Mechanical Engineering from Akdeniz University in Turkey.
                </p>
                <p class="mb-4">
                    I'm passionate about technology and innovation, particularly interested in working with drones, 
                    IoT systems, and smart manufacturing after graduation.
                </p>
                <p class="mb-4">
                    Currently, I'm learning web development technologies including HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Node.js, 
                    and Express. 
                </p>
                <p>
                    In my free time, I like being active in a day and working on practical projects.
        
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>
    
</body>
